  "fixedAt": "packages/cli/src/fixture/angular-factoriolab-build-lanes-run.ts, in `inventoryOf`: the digest is now taken over the file bytes. The shared hasher in angular-factoriolab-migration-run.ts accepts a byte array so that passing bytes is the natural call and passing a decoded string is the odd one. `packages/cli/test/digest-byte-fidelity.test.ts` pins the walker against a fixture whose bytes make the three candidate answers three different digests, so a regression to latin1 — or to a lossy UTF-8 read — fails rather than publishing a wrong number that still compares equal to itself.",
